ceso a terceros).\n• Colegios B2B: Solo acceden al cohorte de su institución contratada.\n• Administradores: Acceso restringido por 2FA a finanzas, facturación y contratos.","textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","containerId":"N3nFIwQnYjarGjIC","originalText":"MATRIZ DE PERMISOS POR ROL (LEAST PRIVILEGE):\n\n• Tutores: Solo acceden a estudiantes asignados y notas. CERO datos financieros ni teléfonos de padres.\n• Padres: Solo consultan avance y asistencia de sus propios hijos (CERO acceso a terceros).\n• Colegios B2B: Solo acceden al cohorte de su institución contratada.\n• Administradores: Acceso restringido por 2FA a finanzas, facturación y contratos.","lineHeight":1.25,"baseline":13,"autoResize":true},{"type":"rectangle","version":1,"versionNonce":850434784,"isDeleted":false,"id":"mvx2gpgq6tHSeiGV","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.5,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0.0,"x":1835.0,"y":2670.0,"strokeColor":"#86EFAC","backgroundColor":"#F0FDF4","width":880.0,"height":230.0,"seed":253915646,"groupIds":[],"frameId":"SLdHtB27ZQ45cmJj","roundness":{"type":3},"boundElements":[{"id":"W1X28oZ7bhms63Fe","type":"text"}],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false},{"type":"text","version":1,"versionNonce":744718219,"isDeleted":false,"id":"W1X28oZ7bhms63Fe","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.5,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0.0,"x":1835.0,"y":2736.4,"strokeColor":"#0F172A","backgroundColor":"transparent","width":880.0,"height":97.2,"seed":542769211,"groupIds":[],"frameId":"SLdHtB27ZQ45cmJj","roundness":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":12,"fontFamily":2,"text":"RÉGIMEN DE COMUNICACIONES COMERCIALES Y MARKETING (LEY 2300 DE 2023):\n\n• Separación estricta: Comunicaciones del servicio (clases, notas) vs Marketing (promociones).\n• Preferencias por canal registradas en base de datos: Email, WhatsApp, SMS, Llamadas.\n• Horarios legales estrictos: Lunes a viernes 7:00 a 19:00, sábados 8:00 a 15:00.\n• Mecanismo de cancelación en un solo clic ('Opt-Out') en todo mensaje comercial enviado.","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"middle","containerId":"mvx2gpgq6tHSeiGV","originalText":"RÉGIMEN DE COMUNICACIONES COMERCIALES Y MARKETING (LEY 2300 DE 2023):\n\n• Separación estricta: Comunicaciones del servicio (clases, notas) vs Marketing (promociones).\n• Preferencias por canal registradas en base de datos: Email, WhatsApp, SMS, Llamadas.\n• Horarios legales estrictos: Lunes a viernes 7:00 a 19:00, sábados 8:00 a 15:00.\n• Mecanismo de cancelación en un solo clic ('Opt-Out') en todo mensaje comercial enviado.","lineHeight":1.25,"baseline":12,"autoResize":true},{"type":"rectangle","version":1,"versionNonce":1357964566,"isDeleted":false,"id":"G7T8UfhBbK79ZfnE","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.5,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0.0,"x":1835.0,"y":2920.0,"strokeColor":"#CBD5E1","backgroundColor":"#F8FAFC","width":880.0,"height":235.0,"seed":552874451,"groupIds":[],"frameId":"SLdHtB27ZQ45cmJj","roundness":{"type":3},"boundElements":[{"id":"3lllaIgkIMPWAS13","type":"text"}],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false},{"type":"text","version":1,"versionNonce":1320086247,"isDeleted":false,"id":"3lllaIgkIMPWAS13","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.5,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0.0,"x":1835.0,"y":2988.9,"strokeColor":"#0F172A","backgroundColor":"transparent","width":880.0,"height":97.2,"seed":1588462400,"groupIds":[],"frameId":"SLdHtB27ZQ45cmJj","roundness":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":12,"fontFamily":2,"text":"RÉGIMEN DE PROPIEDAD INTELECTUAL & BANCO DE PREGUNTAS:\n\n• Activos protegidos: Banco de preguntas ICFES, simulacros, guías, PDFs, videos, plataforma.\n• Prohibición expresa de copia, redistribución, reventa o extracción masiva (scraping).\n• Contratos de tutores con cláusulas de cesión patrimonial y confidencialidad estricta.\n• Regla de Oro: El acceso al contenido académico NO equivale a transferencia de propiedad.","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"middle","containerId":"G7T8UfhBbK79ZfnE","originalText":"RÉGIMEN DE PROPIEDAD INTELECTUAL & BANCO DE PREGUNTAS:\n\n• Activos protegidos: Banco de preguntas ICFES, simulacros, guías, PDFs, videos, plataforma.\n• Prohibición expresa de copia, redistribución, reventa o extracción masiva (scraping).\n• Contratos de tutores con cláusulas de cesión patrimonial y confidencialidad estricta.\n• Regla de Oro: El acceso al contenido académico NO equivale a transferencia de propiedad.","lineHeight":1.25,"baseline":12,"autoResize":true},{"type":"text","version":1,"versionNonce":352119408,"isDeleted":false,"id":"ON5iNyNzTDI6OUFm","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.5,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0.0,"x":60.0,"y":3225.0,"strokeColor":"#64748B","backgroundColor":"transparent","width":87.80000000000001,"height":25.0,"seed":878939035,"groupIds":[],"frameId":"SLdHtB27ZQ45cmJj","roundness":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":11,"fontFamily":2,"text":"LEGEND","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"LEGEND","lineHeight":1.25,"baseline":11},{"type":"rectangle","version":1,"versionNonce":518138417,"isDeleted":false,"id":"A2WobZTOe4aH2PlH","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.5,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0.0,"x":130.0,"y":3225.0,"strokeColor":"#D93829","backgroundColor":"#FFF5F2","width":24.0,"height":14.0,"seed":2119348730,"groupIds":[],"frameId":"SLdHtB27ZQ45cmJj","roundness":{"type":3},"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false},{"type":"text","version":1,"versionNonce":102868947,"isDeleted":false,"id":"g8fdoIkChQ7Un3uI","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.5,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0.0,"x":160.0,"y":3226.0,"strokeColor":"#334155","backgroundColor":"transparent","width":255.00000000000003,"height":25.0,"seed":947